#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Read a bounded, fixed evidence pack from Security Onion Elasticsearch.

This forced-command wrapper is intentionally not a general query proxy.  It
accepts only exact observables and named evidence packs, builds Elasticsearch
Query DSL locally, uses fixed per-pack indices, validates shard/hit metadata,
and records an equivalent KQL filter for analyst audit. Security Onion remains
read-only and neither the caller nor an LLM can choose indices, fields, DSL,
shell arguments, or result sizes.
"""
